The [public Proomptal overview](https://aylith-labs.github.io/proomptal/) is a **static source guide**, not a hosted prompt library, account or AI-tool installation. This separate September study shows the **actual local web app** running against disposable SQLite with three fictional writing and research prompts. It does not change the June source milestone or reuse its withdrawn empty-library stills.

## From a saved card to an exact body

The paired captures use the app's own light and dark themes. The local Bun API and Vite web UI were bound to loopback for the capture. Titles, bodies, tags and the literal topic placeholder are fictional fixture data; no private prompts, provider call or installed AI-tool target were used. The API has no account authentication, so source runs belong inside a trusted local boundary.

